    {
      "source": "<code>ex</code> - the exception to expose (either an pre-built <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutionException</code></a>\nor a cause to be wrapped in an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutionException</code></a>)",
      "translation": "<code>ex</code> - 要抛出的异常（要么是预构建的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutionException</code></a>，要么是要被包装进<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ExecutionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ExecutionException</code></a>的原因）。",
      "count": 2
